  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/06/P1050277.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Este s&aacute;bado se ha celebrado en Tales el D&iacute;a de la Mancomunidad y su feria comercial, evento que se ha aprovechado tambi&eacute;n para conmemorar el 25&ordm; aniversario de la creaci&oacute;n de esta entidad supramunicipal. Por ese motivo han participado los cuatro presidentes que ha tenido la instituci&oacute;n: Ricardo Montoliu, Salvador Zapata, Ximo Estall Poles y Jos&eacute; Medina Lozano.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diafiramancomunitat15/p1050222.jpg\" alt=\"p1050222\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diafiramancomunitat15/p1050223.jpg\" alt=\"p1050223\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diafiramancomunitat15/p1050224.jpg\" alt=\"p1050224\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diafiramancomunitat15/p1050226.jpg\" alt=\"p1050226\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diafiramancomunitat15/p1050227.jpg\" alt=\"p1050227\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diafiramancomunitat15/p1050229.jpg\" alt=\"p1050229\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diafiramancomunitat15/p1050230.jpg\" alt=\"p1050230\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diafiramancomunitat15/p1050232.jpg\" alt=\"p1050232\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a9